Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well,\Nso let's stay with the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our radar is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the many roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That comes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow is waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well,\Nso let's see when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.56,0:01:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our moths will never give up. There's\Na fire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I caused you any disturbance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a devil for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the proprietor\Nof this establishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Send the bill for any\Nrepairs to this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll come by again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were stronger than you let on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could call it second sight,\Nbut there's something that's telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not answering you would be\Nbetter for both our sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You blind or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hurt anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Better for both our sakes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling whoever\Nhe is, he's infamous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we know one thing for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He ain't no ordinary guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My bag's missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my watch is gone, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you want to see my wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has stolen my favorite jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been after the\Nexplosion when dust was everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's infamous, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man seems quite the thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only two here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:03:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Was something taken from you as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my swords is missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My shoes were right here\Na minute ago! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You let him steal the treasure of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they stole from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's what fairies do for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the fairies a gang\Nof thieves or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fairies are fairies, that's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All you can do is laugh and let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisible fairies are the\Nguardians of Dressrosa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,since ancient times and they're our ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When they engage in mischief, the\Nonly thing to do is turn a blind eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if fairies stole from\Nus, I guess that's okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all mental?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Shusui is the national\Ntreasure of the Wano Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my sword, fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It belongs to my entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, one day\NI shall duel with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I might return Shusui to Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to the place it rightfully belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept the duel and I\Nlook forward to beating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got too greedy, fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Furo, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to let you wander all\Nover this city chasing after a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I like where this is headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will let none abscond from this place\Nwith the national treasure of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my arm, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a part of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to settle down and\Nlisten to my idea first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it's just the\Nfive of us on a mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta step up and be\Nthe adult of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You just leave everything\Nup to your old pal Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of Doflamingo's\Nthugs, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this guy needs to be shown\Nwhat a real threat looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,how about you just spill the beans and\Ntell us everything we want to know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I told you guys everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember being ordered to\Nchase around a couple of samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,right, but I don't recall how\Nthey were caught or where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they're currently being\Nheld, and that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I don't have any idea what Smile is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you don't have\Neven the teensiest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, and this factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what a bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even his own foot\Nsoldiers are in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too far down the ladder\Nto know anything important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell us if we can find\Nsomeone higher ranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to have\Na hard time digging up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone else to interrogate in an alleyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been summoned to\Nattend the Coliseum games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can clearly see, the entire\Nkingdom's headed over in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Corridor Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want high-ranking\Nofficials, that's the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's a huge\Nevent going on today,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and all the family's leaders should\Nbe in attendance watching it go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the young master is going to offer an\Nincredible prize to whoever wins the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I had my doubts\Nwhen it was announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the one thing everyone wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that delicious meat\Nbingo was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,While he did say it's something you'd want,\Nit's probably more important than lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not for children's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,People are going to kill each other here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no mere event you're\Ngoing to witness today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty has entrusted us\Nwith the most extraordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,prize to be awarded at the\Nconclusion of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And would you like to know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,First, let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a great warrior who\Nfought in the War of the Best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He perished there two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The second division leader of the infamous
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard crew and son of\Nthe King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the one and only Fire Fist Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he could easily smash\Nthrough a warship with his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,flaming punch and was able\Nto burn down an entire city,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,reducing it to a hellscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear spectators,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am proud to announce that\Nterrifying power has returned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,to this world in the form of\Na Devil Fruit once again Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,that's how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of today's event will receive\Nthis forbidden fruit as their prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's a logia, the most powerful\Ntype of Devil Fruit known to humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary flame flame fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying it's the real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo would never lie\Nabout something this huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Coliseum is packed with excitement today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our king has some of the\Nfiercest warriors from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the new world to sate your\Ngladiatorial pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To win, these warriors will put\Nthemselves through the ultimate test
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll have to earn it with blood, grit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and pain For the defenders of this\Ntribe are no ordinary gladiators
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The champion of each block will\Nhave the fight of their life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Presenting the warriors\Nfrom the Don Quixote family
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor Pink, then Dellinger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lao G,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark Weiss,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and of course, the Colosseum's reigning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The big hero, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the fight already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we want to see some blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Ace's Flame Fruit wind up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I've heard, each and\Nevery Devil Fruit is unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's never more than one\Nof each kind at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,if the owner of the fruit's power dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Devil Fruit with the same power\Nwill suddenly sprout up at some random
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:11:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,place somewhere in the world And the\Nnext person who finds it and eats it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,they become the new holder of its power
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After Firefist Ace died,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,his flame flame fruit was reborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but nobody knew where until the\Nyoung master managed to hunt it down
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems a bit crazy to offer up something\Nlike that as a tournament prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but hey, who am I to judge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, if I could get my\Nhands on power like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,well, I'd carve out a\Nwhole new life for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting\Nanywhere near that fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have an older brother named Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That fruit should be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You could eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd rather not\Nlose my ability to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't eat it since I've\Nalready got Gum-Gum powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But the idea of some random\Nstranger getting their hands on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. It's like a memento of them, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a pretty good possibility\Nthis is a trap, especially with the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,way Doflamingo taunted you with it\Nbut there is one thing I'm sure of:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't let a chance like this\Nslip by you don't want to regret
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,something like that and besides we've\Ngot business at the Coliseum so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's make an appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at those morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Think they can just walk off with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably get themselves killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got no idea what\Nthey're about to walk into.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ferry my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing but a dirty thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you forget about\Na stupid sword or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather forget about your dumb ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting it get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you find the fairy? A fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Such beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Such passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have truly the\Nworld's fun, Miss Dunstan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget how stab-happy the\Nwomen in this country are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy like you's gonna\Nwind up with holes in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She can stab me all she wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard gave me the slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of that moss head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, this is the perfect chance\Nto leave him behind on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I tried to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can argue with me on that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but couples around here like the whole\Ndamn town's trying to make me jealous jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold me in a romantic embrace. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You see where she went?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she slipped out the\Nback door into Lover's Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let her leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can release me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, the pleasure\Nwas entirely mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I bump your nose\Nwith my head, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The only impact I felt was\Nthe shock of meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so much blood. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But it must hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've fallen off a cliff into the\Nbottomless abyss of love. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no, you shouldn't say such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I ignore you, for I've\Nalready given up on love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Any man I've ever been\Ninvolved with was...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they were all able to die happy men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those goons back there, who were\Nthey and why were they chasing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do\Nto help, just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Those men were the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there was a\Nman, and things between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They went sour, and then I stabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're saying? It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The women here are so passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That they stabbed for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're okay with stabbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, not to indulge\Nthis wicked woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What don't take that risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I might fall in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And once we arrive, there is a man\Nthere I need you to kill for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that coliseum is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowd's going nuts in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes me want to sign\Nup for the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, listen to all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, fugitive toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these days, we're\Ngoing to catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep trying, you suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Jetwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too slow! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My foot is placed in the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really need to\Nremind you of the law, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As you both know, the police and the\NNavy are forbidden from entering here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if\Nyou're chasing a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not your jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The only rule of law within these walls\Nis that of the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you choose to pull those triggers,\Nthen you will be the ones thrown in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, elderly gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,May I offer to carry\Nyour belongings for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure got polite in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one funny soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you find me funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right now, can you clear the path?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was blocking your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, your face turned\Nas red as your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pretty serious guy\Ndeep down, ain't you? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Toys only exist to make people smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no such\Nthing as a serious toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's all mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Last chance to sign up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Entries for the public are closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:19:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like anyone actually has\Nthe guts to enter this contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we just found\Nyour ticket inside. Hm? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna enter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That geezer must be out\Nof his mind or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he even know who he's\Ngoing to be battling against?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I've heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they've got some heavy hitters from the\Nnew world who are dying to get that fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to promise me just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight however you want, but\Ndon't let them know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sign your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the waiting room for competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here until we call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about action central, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame, flame fruit is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again, you blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.46,0:20:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rrrrrrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we can use any weapon we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of joke? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's the final entrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Against warriors like us, get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is more than a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an insult to every gladiator here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull, Squirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Think that fake beard\Nmakes you look tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about him, Spartan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell wants to see the\Nweak get crushed to a bloody pulp?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowd thirsts for battles\Nbetween strong and manly warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no place for the\Nlikes of you, so piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a place!
